# Thread working directories. A thread's cwd holds its Claude state, its
# browser-automation scratch, and whatever screenshots it took while driving a
# live GUI - sonnet2's pinball captures alone are 12M. No thread dir has ever
# held tracked source (verified), so they are ignored whole rather than by a
# */*.png glob that would silently swallow a real file later.
